# DIRECTIVE ZERO — AM-01 sshd_config
# Plain SSH on :22. No restricted-shell trick — `ssh compliance@host`
# gives a normal /bin/bash. Difficulty lives in reaching the cred.

Port 22
AddressFamily any
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0

PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication yes
PubkeyAuthentication yes

ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
UsePAM yes

X11Forwarding no
PrintMotd yes

AcceptEnv LANG LC_*
Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/openssh/sftp-server